\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":397.42,"y":162.32,"cell":272,"i":27,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=426302823272\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=426302823272\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":307.6,"y":678.3,"cell":4625,"i":28,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=4263028234625\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=4263028234625\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":1403.95,"y":765.03,"cell":5305,"i":29,"name":"Yevaqeerno Monster","note":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 21 ft long inhabits Yevaqeerno Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":293.58,"y":288,"cell":928,"i":30,"name":"Aldock Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 20 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":1215.8,"y":662.6,"cell":4438,"i":31,"name":"Hacury Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 32 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":456.25,"y":400.39,"cell":1871,"i":32,"name":"Ashmel Monster","note":"Locals speak of a feared Monster who inhabits Ashmel hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1173.27,"y":506.88,"cell":2830,"i":33,"name":"Thvethyr Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Eldar (Elfish) Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1664.24,"y":605.64,"cell":4025,"i":34,"name":"Dirdud Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Faith of the Giant Elder."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1507.59,"y":445.63,"cell":2426,"i":35,"name":"Vrarud Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Faith of the Giant Elder."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":670.04,"y":238.86,"cell":544,"i":36,"name":"Aethes Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Old Quenian (Elfish) Druids."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1345.52,"y":586.95,"cell":3693,"i":37,"name":"Verdin Wolverines","note":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":426.74,"y":530.78,"cell":3040,"i":38,"name":"Kelfadiral Bears","note":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":492.05,"y":393.99,"cell":1874,"i":39,"name":"Ryanariendo Bears","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1009.19,"y":352.14,"cell":1527,"i":40,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":689.85,"y":338.35,"cell":1412,"i":41,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1777.3,"y":484,"cell":2656,"i":42,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1487.15,"y":669.78,"cell":4593,"i":43,"name":"Dhodh Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳒⳐⳊⳤⳜ⳩ⳖⲲⳤⲸⳀⲸⲴⳎⳢⳂⳬⳔⳫ ⳫⳲⳖⳁⳠⳬⳌⳔ⳥⳪ ⳎⳚ⳩ⳈⳈⲾⳆ⳧Ⲵ ⳎⳫ ⳥ⳌⳫⳈⳌⳆⳢⳃⳁⳈⳤⳞⳭⲴ⳾⳥Ⳮ⳾ⳃ ⲸⳭⳢ⳪ⳐⳊⳢ⳩ⳔⳜⳖⲲⲺⳀⲶ⳪ⳚⳐⲸ ⳾ⳁⳭⳊⳜ⳥Ⲹ ⲼⳌⳞⲲⳈ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1717.88,"y":519.29,"cell":2996,"i":44,"name":"Vrobror Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠡᠲᢦᡜᢡᠯᠽᢀᢤᢜᢜᠨᡙᡱᡎᢥᡀᡴᡝᡒᢏᡟᡍᡙᡰᢀᡏᠮ᠀ᡭᢐᠾᠠᢦ᠒ᡱᢀ᠑ᡖᡓ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1361.19,"y":574.03,"cell":3551,"i":45,"name":"Zulbruz Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲸⲼⳬⳆ⳧ ⳹ⳊⳘ⳧Ⳉ⳹ⳢⳜ ⳃⳐⳎⳬⳜⳁⳄⳊ⳪ⳌⳎⳈⳔⳫ ⳃⲺⳘ ⲸⳆⳤⳤ Ⳕ ⳞⳆⳤⲴ⳥ⳘⳚ ⳁⳁⲸⲺ⳩Ⲹ⳧ⳔⳤⲾⳊ ⳁⳈ⳧ⳂⳞⳒⳚⳚⳖⳄⳀⳒⲴⳐⳁ⳪Ⲹ⳧ⳤ ⳌⳞ Ⳓ ⳧ⲼⳢⳀⳠⲾ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":104.2,"y":575.7,"cell":3448,"i":46,"name":"Ruined Settlement","note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":545.26,"y":327.33,"cell":1288,"i":47,"name":"Ruined Temple","note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":540.78,"y":136.22,"cell":206,"i":48,"name":"Ruined Settlement","note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":1626.77,"y":487.96,"cell":2750,"i":49,"name":"Razadh Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1284.05,"y":528.58,"cell":3110,"i":50,"name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":272.23,"y":590.31,"cell":3613,"i":51,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":593.93,"y":464.96,"cell":2478,"i":52,"name":"Reidor Joust","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of brutality in Reidor, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1234.04,"y":615.73,"cell":3991,"i":53,"name":"Ollmlunala Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Ollmlunala, offering local vinegar, preserved food, and boots alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":1677.17,"y":387.18,"cell":1846,"i":54,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Gamunzdusha River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":719.57,"y":119.63,"cell":144,"i":55,"name":"Foxes migration","note":"A huge group of foxes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":474.61,"y":418.94,"cell":2132,"i":56,"name":"Lirena Grotto","note":"The Lirena Grotto. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1609.55,"y":683.36,"cell":4748,"i":57,"name":"Ibrokh Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1286.56,"y":231.3,"cell":580,"i":58,"name":"Boulow Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":993.34,"y":541.61,"cell":3238,"i":59,"name":"Eshmera Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1511.38,"y":352.14,"cell":1570,"i":60,"name":"Gugh Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1198.54,"y":387.41,"cell":1794,"i":61,"name":"Hluiriatheas Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":834.1,"y":402.5,"cell":1906,"i":62,"name":"Keathana Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1116.79,"y":311.63,"cell":1215,"i":63,"name":"Cysaleandene Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1468.07,"y":664.39,"cell":4592,"i":64,"name":"Zrad Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":710.91,"y":387.33,"cell":1890,"i":65,"name":"Kelsyalas Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":399.5,"y":115.8,"cell":119,"i":66,"name":"Interdimensional Rift","note":"A rumoured interdimensional rift in this area is causing all known nearby beings to flee in terror."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":977.62,"y":740.32,"cell":5192,"i":67,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":666.18,"y":226.63,"cell":484,"i":68,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1064.4,"y":769.7,"cell":5329,"i":69,"name":"Skipton Necropolis","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":439.5,"y":418.93,"cell":2129,"i":70,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2129\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":586.76,"y":452.81,"cell":2369,"i":71,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2369\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1715.4,"y":337.35,"cell":1471,"i":72,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1471\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":468.15,"y":367.92,"cell":1612,"i":73,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1612\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1206.74,"y":560.58,"cell":3399,"i":74,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3399\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":492.44,"y":264.81,"cell":716,"i":75,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/716\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a9","type":"part